  "details": "1. Create a new group instance and during creation choose the option to link it to an event\n\n2. Go to create another instance of any type\n\n3. Observe that the name of the event from before is pre-filled in the name field.\n\nThe event name persists in the box any time you make a new instance, even after restarting the game, until it is cleared manually. This seems like really bad UX, prone to people accidentally leaving the instance name without even realizing, potentially for days, weeks, months entirely by accident until they realize and clear it.",
